            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lovestohost"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Who knew butter could be even better than...butter?! Super easy and super awesome. Do not serve shellfish w/out it. THANK YOU, Dasisalles!!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LovesCooking"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe beautifully and easily demystifies that delicious butter dip that you find at top seafood restaurants. I followed the directions and it came out to be as delicious as it was in the restaurants. Now I should just prepare a homemade seafood tower to go with it. This will be a family favorite for sure.",
            "datePublished": "2025-02-06T22:26:20.093Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
